      ],
      "source": "https://westonhistoricalmuseum.org/past-to-present-1900-to-today/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Weston’s citizens joined the United States’ call to arms in World Wars I and II, and later served in Korea, Vietnam, Kuwait, Iraq, and Afghanistan.",
